<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nŏtārĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		nota, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to writing in cipher</i>
			or <i>short-hand writing</i>
			(post-Aug.).—Only as <i>subst.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nŏtārĭus</span></b> ,
			ii, m.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>A short-hand writer, stenographer</i> (syn.
			actuarius), <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 3, 5, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 7,
				2, 24</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 5, 51, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 208</span></i>
			<i>in lemm.;</i>
			<i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev.
			28</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>a writer,
				secretary, clerk, amanuensis</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">notarium voco et quae formaverim dicto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 9, 36, 2</span></i>
			; Val. ap. Treb. <i><span class="en">Claud. 14</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Amm. 17, 5,
			15</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nŏtārĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>The art of writing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in puerilibus litteris prima abecedaria,
					secunda notaria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fulg. Myth. 3, 10</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>A written information, indictment</i>, <i><span class="en">Aug. Ep.
				169</span></i> dub.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
